  "result": "All 617 existing tests pass, and type-checking is clean. The fixes address each reported scenario:\n\n- **Labels**: `assertOwnLabels` in `issue-service.ts` verifies every `labelId` on create/update resolves to a live label actually owned by the org.\n- **Parent issues**: `assertValidParent` requires the parent to exist, be unarchived, and belong to the same project.\n- **Replies**: `createComment` now requires `parentId` to reference a live, top-level (non-reply) comment on the same issue.\n- **Assignee / project lead**: `assertAssignableMember` / `assertLeadableMember` require the target user to be a current active member of the org.\n- **Mentions**: `resolveMentionedUsers` now filters both body-parsed and composer-supplied mentions down to current active members, dropping (not erroring on) anyone else.",
